Place TLS certs here for HTTPS (port 443).

To enable HTTPS, create:
  ssl/cert.pem
  ssl/key.pem

Self-signed (localhost) one-liner from repo root:
  openssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 -keyout ssl/key.pem -out ssl/cert.pem -subj "/CN=localhost"

Then uncomment the HTTPS server block in the repo root `nginx.conf` (if you run your own nginx) and reload that proxy.

Production TLS is normally terminated at **Cloudflare** (or your provider), not via this repo’s compose files.
